    "storage": {
      "value": "<p><br />All observations recorded against the concept Bacteriology Concept Set and it&rsquo;s children will be in one table.<strong> </strong>All multi select and add more sections under this concept will become separate tables.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>configuration</strong></h3><h5><strong>ColumnsToIgnore apply for this module ( Refer </strong><a href=\"https://msfprojects.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/329875787/Appendix\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">https://msfprojects.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/329875787/Appendix</a> <strong>)</strong></h5><p>Currently bacteriology job is running with full load</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0b1fdb32-5642-46c5-8778-70ae81cb50b3\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[{\n      \"name\": \"Bacteriology Data\",\n      \"conceptReferenceSource\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"bacteriology\",\n      \"columnsToIgnore\": [\n        \"Image\",\n        \"Video\"\n      ]\n    }\n]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"518c1e94-6a51-4ba9-b8d8-a5219ba4b029\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><strong>If any modification done to existing bacteriology post encounter ends then it won&rsquo;t sync to mart with incremental config</strong></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><hr /><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Existing OpenMRS tables</h3><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"6bfa3424-02d3-42e4-898c-d53cfa5edc67\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[Obs\nvisit\nprogram\npatient_program\nlocation\n]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><hr /><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Flattened Mart Tables</h3><p>Since we do not have add mores/ multi-selects in bacteriology form in demo environment, there will be only one table :- <strong>bacteriology_concept_set</strong> which will have all the details.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"7cddd4d2-87da-466b-ac2d-817797345d92\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[bacteriology_concept_set]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>Some of the columns in this table are as follows. Others columns are not mentioned here</p><table data-layout=\"default\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /><col style=\"width: 340.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Column Name</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Description</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>id_bacteriology_concept_set</p></td><td><p>Id reference to bacteriology concept set from &nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>patient_id</p></td><td><p>&nbsp;Id reference to patient from patient table in openmrs</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>visit_id</p></td><td><p>Id reference for a visit</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>encounter_id</p></td><td><p>In which encounter data is captured</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>obs_datetime</p></td><td><p>Observation date and time</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>date_created</p></td><td><p>Date when Bacteriology details are filled for the first time</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>date_modified</p></td><td><p>Date of recent Bacteriology details updation</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>location_id</p></td><td><p>Location code</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>location_name</p></td><td><p>Location name</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>program_id</p></td><td><p>Program code</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>program_name</p></td><td><p>Name of the program</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>patient_program_id</p></td><td><p>Id reference to patient program from patient_program table in openmrs</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Specimen_collection date</p></td><td><p>Date of collection of the specimen</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>specimen_sample_source_noncoded</p></td><td><p>Free text answers for sample source not available in DB</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>specimen_sample_source</p></td><td><p>Predefined answers for sample source available in DB</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>specimen_id</p></td><td><p>Unique id for specific observation</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><hr /><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Translations</strong></h3><p>if we need to get those values as per the translations we need to add the below <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0,184,217);\">locale tag</span></strong> in the &ldquo;<strong>/var/www/bahmni_config/bahmni-mart/bahmni-mart.json</strong>&ldquo; file.</p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f0b6523c-9a97-4804-803b-315973142b1a\"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[{\n      \"name\": \"Bacteriology Data\",\n      \"conceptReferenceSource\": \"\",\n      \"type\": \"bacteriology\",\n      \"locale\" : \"fr\"\n    }\n]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p>",
